# Google Workspace Calendar

## Gate

Use when the user asks about events, meetings, free/busy, OOO, or focus time.
Prefer Google Workspace MCP.

## Defaults

1. Resolve calendar id from MCP defaults or a named calendar — never invent.
2. Confirm timezone from the event or calendar; state times clearly.
3. Creating or moving events needs an explicit ask; cancelling/deleting needs
   a clear destructive verb.
4. Prefer free/busy checks before booking over someone else’s calendar.
5. OOO / focus time: use the dedicated MCP helpers when available.

## Refuse

- Do not invite external guests the user did not name.
- Do not wipe a calendar range without an explicit ask.
